## 2. Root Cause
1. In `src/components/WebGPUCanvas.tsx`, the SVG note `<g>` elements only bind `onClick` and lack `onMouseDown`, `window.mousemove`, and `window.mouseup` drag state tracking.
2. In `src/components/SplitWorkspace.tsx`, `handleCanvasMutation(eventData, deltaX)` only accepts `deltaX` with a hardcoded `zScale = 100` and does not apply `semitoneDelta` pitch transposition.
3. In `src/mutator/TopologicalMutator.ts`, `transposePitch` always transposes all notes in a chord rather than targeting the specific `originalMidi` voice that the user dragged, and `resizeDuration` throws if a note uses sticky duration inheritance (`durationPart === null`).

